      }
    ],
    "status": "present",
    "value": "Generate n pairwise-distinct NFTs (uniform sampling without replacement modelled deterministically). Index all T = product(len(values)) combinations in mixed-radix order (first trait most significant, values in given order). Run a partial Fisher-Yates over that virtual array: for i in 0..n-1, swap positions i and i + (randoms[i] mod (T - i)) and emit the combination at position i. If n > T return []. randoms has exactly n entries. Randomness is injected: randoms is a deterministic list of non-negative integers (each <= 10^15) consumed in order. Each NFT is returned as the list of chosen values in trait order."
  },
